  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">YAL - Asuma - AgroStrech</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agribusiness/ Food Processing .Beneficiaries: YAL Youth 55 of which 38 are women. ..The grant will be used to increase food security by developing sustainable, efficient and affordable products and services for smallholder farmers directed to improving the quantity and quality of produce supplied to the consumer. The purpose of the Project is to increase the profitability of smallholder agricultural production by ensuring that more of their farm output reaches the final consumer in a functional and safe form...The grant funds will be used to: (a) purchase puree machinery such as boiler, homogenizer, and sauce packing; (b) miscellaneous equipment required for tomato processing; (c) initial inputs; and (d) transportation logistics. .</narrative>
  </description>
